      "text": {
        "jp": "かくして、世界は引き裂かれ……\r\nこの戦いは歴史の闇に葬られた。",
        "official_en": "And so the world was riven, and the battle was relegated to the pages of history.",
        "real_en": "And so the world was torn apart...\r\nAnd that battle was buried in the darkness of history."
