      "text": {
        "jp": "世界有数の騎士団に守られたこの国で、\r\n人々は穏やかな日々を過ごしていた。",
        "official_en": "In the realm protected by one of the world’s preeminent knight orders,\r\nthe people of the kingdom lead a peaceful life.",
        "real_en": "Protected by one of the finest orders of knights in the world,\r\nits people lived peaceful lives."
